    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Agenda 2030 and SDG 16
- Executive Decree 135/14 on Provincial Human Rights Committees (CPDH)
- Angola is signatory to 5 of the 9 core International HR Treaties and 5 of the 7 core African people&apos;s rights instruments
- National Strategy for Human Rights Education (ENEDH)
- Universal PeriodiC Review (UPR) recommendations are not totally implemented.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
